{"availability":"available","full":"MichaelWave369/PhiStream","name":"PhiStream","description":"Original memory-tiered inference research engine | v0.1.0 experimental  Developed for the MichaelWave369 ecosystem. Independent from AirLLM; no code, dependency, architecture adapter or model weights copied from AirLLM. The general technique of layer-by-layer execution is a widely known concept, not a proprietary algorithm.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T00:58:21Z","updated":"2026-10-14T04:48:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://michaelwave369.github.io/PhiStream/","topics":[],"demo":"https://michaelwave369.github.io/PhiStream/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T00:51:38.969Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T00:51:38.969Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T00:51:38.969Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.300Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T00:51:38.969Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Original memory-tiered inference research engine | v0.1.0 experimental","Developed for the MichaelWave369 ecosystem. Independent from AirLLM; no code, dependency, architecture adapter or model weights copied from AirLLM. The general technique of layer-by-layer execution is a widely known concept, not a proprietary algorithm.","Status: CPU-correctness prototype. The model is a deterministic untrained miniature decoder, so generated tokens have no language meaning. No support yet for existing Llama/Qwen checkpoints. CUDA operations are implemented using PyTorch but must be verified on actual NVIDIA hardware. No 70B/405B claim and no speedup claim."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MichaelWave369/PhiStream/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b7db578238611af748bc85519f3cde028a1a6570b63b06ef2a1e1c814fc65b67","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.414Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:10.414Z","pro